Track 2: Anchor Holds My Stitch
- Story & Context: Nenek Fitri, recalling a moment of profound doubt during a particularly difficult weaving project decades ago when her grandmother told her the secret of resilience, laid down this track after a long session, the tabla rhythms replicating the intricate struggle and eventual triumph of a complex pattern. She whispers that "The deepest roots, they are not seen."
